# Help!, end of the refrain as Pollack hears it (figure 6.7)
# His bracketed E (V) on "help" is not on the rhythm track but implied by the voices; it is kept
# with its brackets in the numeral.
key A

system
# lyrics as typed by Pollack are omitted here; x marks each sung syllable
words "Sung rhythm" | x | x x | x | r |
chords   | A{I} | - E{(V)} | A{I} | - |
